  "summary": "Celebrate festive occasions with this decadent <b>Thai stuffed roti flatbread</b>, a luxurious dish featured during special holiday feasts and gatherings. Hand-kneaded dough made with wheat flour, sweetened <b>condensed milk</b>, and rich ghee creates flaky, multi-layered flatbreads with a golden, crispy exterior. The savory filling stars aromatic <b>minced chicken</b> sautéed with fragrant yellow curry paste, sweet diced onions, and rich coconut cream, offering an intoxicating blend of spices and rich textures. Each dough portion is stretched paper-thin, filled with egg and spiced meat, folded into a neat square envelope, and pan-fried to perfection in hot melted ghee. The result is a stunning contrast between crispy buttered crust and tender savory filling that elevates street food to majestic heights. Serve warm, cut into bite-sized squares accompanied by sweet cucumber relish for a festive feast that will impress family and friends alike.",
